Binary releases
---------------
A binary release (the zip on the Releases page) also contains the .NET runtime, the NuGet packages of the programs
and the engine natives. Its NOTICE.txt lists each component, its version and its license, and its folder "licenses"
holds each license text. tools/release.ps1 makes them from release/third-party.json and release/licenses/.
A binary release contains no game files.
